{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FISH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture Amalgams using your crane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/optimized_catch_gif.gif?t=1749068666\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAPTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Amalgams in your ship's hold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/optimized_turtle.gif?t=1749068666\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SAIL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse The Installation with your fishing ship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/ship_optimized.gif?t=1749068666\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a mysterious accident, a secret scientific facility is left unused and abandoned, however, there are still objects of interest inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job is to recover Amalgams, creatures created from a mass-manufactured microorganism that has the ability to merge multiple animal species into one, or exaggerate characteristics of existing species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amalgams are manufactured in cells isolated from each other. Due to the nature of the microorganism used, the facilities must be partially submerged in a liquid specifically created to favor its reproduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is why the installation can only be accessed by ships, so the facilities are designed for transport and circulation with maritime vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the Amalgams are created, they are captured in F-Pots, cages designed for their safe transport. These cages are kept submerged with the Amalgam inside until they emerge via activation of their associated buoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ship is equipped with a crane capable of transporting and activating F-Pots, you must use it to pick up the Amalgams and store them in your hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the time of the accident the Amalgams were sedated by the automatic safety system, but it cannot be ruled out that some of them are still active.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072380?t=1749068666","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072380?t=1749068666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/039b8c014324f878b2a4d0f407723b15dc86963d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749068666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/039b8c014324f878b2a4d0f407723b15dc86963d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749068666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FISH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture Amalgams using your crane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/optimized_catch_gif.gif?t=1749068666\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CAPTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Amalgams in your ship's hold</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/optimized_turtle.gif?t=1749068666\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SAIL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse The Installation with your fishing ship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/ship_optimized.gif?t=1749068666\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a mysterious accident, a secret scientific facility is left unused and abandoned, however, there are still objects of interest inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job is to recover Amalgams, creatures created from a mass-manufactured microorganism that has the ability to merge multiple animal species into one, or exaggerate characteristics of existing species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amalgams are manufactured in cells isolated from each other. Due to the nature of the microorganism used, the facilities must be partially submerged in a liquid specifically created to favor its reproduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is why the installation can only be accessed by ships, so the facilities are designed for transport and circulation with maritime vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the Amalgams are created, they are captured in F-Pots, cages designed for their safe transport. These cages are kept submerged with the Amalgam inside until they emerge via activation of their associated buoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ship is equipped with a crane capable of transporting and activating F-Pots, you must use it to pick up the Amalgams and store them in your hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the time of the accident the Amalgams were sedated by the automatic safety system, but it cannot be ruled out that some of them are still active.</p>","developers":["Ferran Costa Casanova"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/d71f79d661f88b7966a4746f0cf35c2ddab1855a/header.jpg?t=1749068666","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145174,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145174/movie480.mp4?t=1748174448","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145174/movie_max.mp4?t=1748174448"},"name":"Undesired Catch | Cinematic Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145174/da257eb3cfa6bf32a566ca82c55e1ad4ccc26d1e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748174448","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145174/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748174448","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145174/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748174448"}}],"name":"Undesired Catch","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 | AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon 300 | GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers